{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Title.png?t=1744784647\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Objective:</strong> Deliver unpredictable cargo at all costs, no matter the challenges!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Collaborate with your crew to keep the ship running and handle emergencies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reputation:</strong> Unlock new sectors and upgrade your ship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Launch_the_ship.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DELIVER THE CARGO, AT ALL COSTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: deliver your unpredictable cargo to its destination, no matter what. Unexpected challenges await, but the cargo must arrive safe and sound.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Llama_on_fire.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEAMWORK BEFORE EVERYTHING FALLS APART</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you and your crew must work together to keep the ship in shape: extinguish fires, repair leaks, and handle every <strong>emergency</strong> that arises. <strong>Communication is key</strong>: things can spiral out of control quickly, and you can't be everywhere at once. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Whale_attack.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FROM ZERO TO GALACTIC HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to your hard-earned <strong>reputation</strong> (and a bit of luck), unlock new sectors of the universe and llama deliveries with completely <strong>insane</strong> powers! Once the mission is complete, collect rewards to upgrade your ship with increasingly <strong>powerful</strong> equipment and systems.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819410?t=1744784647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744784647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744784647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/a9d863bbe2cd9b19e37e379b2e688bb7f563202b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744784647","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Title.png?t=1744784647\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Objective:</strong> Deliver unpredictable cargo at all costs, no matter the challenges!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Collaborate with your crew to keep the ship running and handle emergencies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reputation:</strong> Unlock new sectors and upgrade your ship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Launch_the_ship.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DELIVER THE CARGO, AT ALL COSTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission is simple: deliver your unpredictable cargo to its destination, no matter what. Unexpected challenges await, but the cargo must arrive safe and sound.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Llama_on_fire.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEAMWORK BEFORE EVERYTHING FALLS APART</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive, you and your crew must work together to keep the ship in shape: extinguish fires, repair leaks, and handle every <strong>emergency</strong> that arises. <strong>Communication is key</strong>: things can spiral out of control quickly, and you can't be everywhere at once. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/Whale_attack.gif?t=1744784647\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FROM ZERO TO GALACTIC HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to your hard-earned <strong>reputation</strong> (and a bit of luck), unlock new sectors of the universe and llama deliveries with completely <strong>insane</strong> powers! Once the mission is complete, collect rewards to upgrade your ship with increasingly <strong>powerful</strong> equipment and systems.</p>","developers":["Tin Can Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/header.jpg?t=1744784647","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Space Chaos","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 880MM or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Sto